# Build artifacts
/target/
/build/

# NOTE: dist/*.deps are deliberately TRACKED (they were listed here until 2.0.1,
# while also being tracked — an incoherent state). `cyrius deps` validates a
# consumer's `[deps] stdlib` against them, so they are part of the published
# contract, and prakash maintains them itself via scripts/sync-deps-sidecar.sh
# because the generator's base-vs-profile rule is backwards for our inverted
# two-bundle layout. See that script's header.

# Cyrius toolchain tarball (fetched during CI)
cyrius-*.tar.gz

# Cargo.lock — kept ignored; prakash is a Cyrius library with no Cargo build.
# (The `rust-old/` archive was removed in 2.2.3; see the CHANGELOG.)
Cargo.lock

# Editor / IDE
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Debugging
*.pdb
core
core.*

# Claude Code
.claude/

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
